OL,3,GNEWSAArtist creates graffiti studio
OL,4,Amade entirely of felt
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist who creates exhibitions made
OL,7,Fentirely of felt said it was a "dream
OL,8,Fcome true" to create one based on
OL,9,Fstreet art.
OL,11,FLucy Sparrow, who is based in Sudbury,
OL,12,FSuffolk, started making things out of
OL,13,Ffelt as a child before turning her
OL,14,Fhobby into a career 11 years ago.
OL,16,FShe has gone on to hold numerous felt
OL,17,Fexhibitions across the world, including
OL,18,Fwhen she opened an interactive felt
OL,19,Ffish and chip shop last year.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
