OL,3,GNEWSAArtist creates graffiti studio
OL,4,Amade entirely of felt
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer latest exhibition depicts a
OL,7,Fgraffiti artist's studio as part of the
OL,8,Fwider Beyond the Streets show at the
OL,9,FSaatchi Gallery in London, which she
OL,10,Fsaid was an "honour" to be part of.
